Oxigraph is a graph database implementing the SPARQL standard.

It offers a SPARQL query engine and an HTTP server implementing the
SPARQL 1.1 Protocol and SPARQL 1.1 Graph Store HTTP Protocol. The
database is backed by RocksDB for durable storage.

Supported RDF formats include Turtle, TriG, N-Triples, N-Quads,
RDF/XML, and JSON-LD. The server provides a web UI with a SPARQL
query interface.
